<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS-no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount NB-no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		 15/5 D	July	     15/5 D</p>
<p> August	    40/48 P	August	  40/48 P</p>
<p> Sept	    100/110 P	Sept	  100/110 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		38/35 D	July	    38/35 D</p>
<p> August	     12/9 D	August	   12/9 D</p>
<p> Sept		  5/8 P	Sept		5/8 P</p>
